📚 Key Takeaways

✔ Wrapper Classes convert primitives into objects
✔ Java provides wrappers for all primitive types
✔ Autoboxing converts primitive → object automatically
✔ Unboxing converts object → primitive automatically
✔ Wrapper classes provide useful utility methods

